invalid type: string "# Emergency Department Thoracotomy (EDT)\n\nFor penetrating trauma patients who lose vital signs, to perform internal cardiac massage and hemorrhage control.\n\n# Late Management (Non-Emergent Surgery)\n\n# VATS (Video-Assisted Thoracoscopic Surgery)\n\nFor Retained Hemothorax (48-72 hours).\n\n# Surgical Rib Fixation\n\nFor severe Flail Chest (within 48-72 hours).", expected